# Mascot artwork. The ball serves whatever sits beside its package, so anything
# dropped in becomes the default appearance. Everything here is ignored except
# the files this repository ships on purpose, so artwork you add locally stays
# out of history while the committed mascot and its notices remain tracked.
# See packages/dsh-client-ui-ball/assets/README.md and NOTICE.md.
packages/*/assets/*
!packages/*/assets/README.md
!packages/*/assets/mascot.png
